module gunbc.recurring_failure_mode.roster

// THE ROSTER IS THE ENUMERATION AND NOTHING ELSE, held apart from `gunbc.recurring_failure_mode`
// because the import graph's one structural law is acyclicity: every row module imports the
// `RecurringFailureMode` type from that module, so the module carrying the type cannot import the
// rows back. The type is the shape, the files are the facts, and this module is the list.
//
// ORDER IS SOURCE ORDER AND IS LOAD-BEARING: the projection renders rows in roster order, so
// sorting this list would reorder docs/design-failure-modes.md and destroy the empty-diff oracle
// that proves a cut was structural. Append at the end.

